{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is a medium-length single-player adventure game. You play as a young man who returns to a small town to his parents to restore an old church. Talk to the townspeople and help them. Help your father remember his past.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game mainly consists of dialogues and simple puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten takes about 4 hours to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game interface is minimalistic and does not distract from the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics with an emphasis on realism and VR will help you fully immerse yourself in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are few locations in the game, and the main plot takes place in one small town. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Ten, you cannot lose or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is created for reflection and calm long dialogues, and not for action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is a game about getting to know God and the importance of following his Commandments.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427130?t=1752771600","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752771600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427130/6205472ce290556a92447f88515bed5828733541/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752771600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427130/6205472ce290556a92447f88515bed5828733541/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752771600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is a medium-length single-player adventure game. You play as a young man who returns to a small town to his parents to restore an old church. Talk to the townspeople and help them. Help your father remember his past.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game mainly consists of dialogues and simple puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten takes about 4 hours to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game interface is minimalistic and does not distract from the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphics with an emphasis on realism and VR will help you fully immerse yourself in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are few locations in the game, and the main plot takes place in one small town. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Ten, you cannot lose or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is created for reflection and calm long dialogues, and not for action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ten is a game about getting to know God and the importance of following his Commandments.</p>","developers":["Reform.media"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427130/c061555a43fbd6f153d2e894f1eebe6e15d92982/header.jpg?t=1752771600","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3427130/1793938768/a660484d3b7daa9e4a5c824115872fd303954e56/1751562020/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751647117","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3427130/1793938768/a660484d3b7daa9e4a5c824115872fd303954e56/1751562020/dash